OL,3,AFirst minister demands 'new deal' from
OL,4,AAndy Burnham to make Wales equal with
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth has
OL,8,Fdemanded a "new deal" for Wales from
OL,9,Fthe UK government that would put the
OL,10,Fcountry on an equal footing with
OL,11,FScotland.
OL,13,FIn a letter he requested powers over
OL,14,Fpolicing, justice, rail and the Crown
OL,15,FEstate top be transferred to Cardiff.
OL,17,FIn a speech at Plaid Cymru's conference
OL,18,Fin Llandudno, the party's leader said
OL,19,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,20,Fpromised him he would not undermine
OL,21,FWales.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
