OL,3,AFirst minister demands 'new deal' from
OL,4,AAndy Burnham to make Wales equal with
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government said it was
OL,8,F"committed to building a stronger and
OL,9,Ffairer Wales in a stronger and fairer
OL,10,FUnited Kingdom".
